# Read by scripts/build.sh (FILES= in the "upstream" file next to this list): one
# "<url> <sha256>" line per file. build.sh downloads each file into build/, checks its
# SHA-256, and packs all of them, by basename, into the one orig tarball. The SHA-256 of
# the Nerd Fonts zip is the one Omarchy's recipe records (omacom/omarchy-pkgs,
# pkgbuilds/ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd-basic/PKGBUILD, 2026-10-10) and matched the download
# the same day. The iA Writer SHA-256s were computed on 2026-10-10 from downloads whose
# SHA-512s match Omarchy's recipe (pkgbuilds/ttf-ia-writer/PKGBUILD, pkgver 20261002.r63).

